The neutral material tone the image implies rather than shows: the color a physical object in this image would be made of, or the base color a designer would extend the image's edges into. It is the quieter, slightly duller neighbour of background_colors. When choosing between the two, the one that could be tiled across a large flat area is surface_colors, and the one the subject is photographed against is background_colors. Do not return the same color under both.
